{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a cameraman, filming dead bodies and unseen horrors from the past, and instantly changing what the Death Counter watches in the future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU PLAY AS A CAMERAMAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character isn't the player\u2014it's the Death Counter (you'll see her hand counting most of the time). Your goal as the player is to influence her by showing what you're filming. You are a cameraman from the past, trying to influence someone in the future.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/6ba15bcd46f10d2e790bde77a9793c2e.poster.avif?t=1770796239\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/6ba15bcd46f10d2e790bde77a9793c2e.webm?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/6ba15bcd46f10d2e790bde77a9793c2e.mp4?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark merge of two art styles, periods, and settings. One captured in haunting films of forbidden labs, the other a shadowy office where Death Counters view them. Spirits sealed in the footage break into the office, moving from past to present, altering objects and unsettling players with paranormal activities. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/d9541dc44f1652692f797c39ea931ba8.poster.avif?t=1770796239\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/d9541dc44f1652692f797c39ea931ba8.webm?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/d9541dc44f1652692f797c39ea931ba8.mp4?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1963, the CIA began rating its archived classified footage based on the deaths captured on them. Each rating process had to be documented on camera by an assigned agent, whom they later called a &quot;Death Counter.&quot;<br> <br> Four 8mm films, shot by unnamed operatives between 1939 and 1959, were prepared for evaluation. This game is the complete process, as recorded by the Death Counters tasked with evaluating those haunting footage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as unnamed operatives from the past, tasked with filming the insides of secret laboratories worldwide. A Death Counter watches your footage in real-time and reacts based on what you show her on the screen.  <br><br>Your goal is to capture as many deaths as possible on film, ensuring the Death Counter sees them by filming corpses, unseen horrors, and beyond, to maximize her recorded death count.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/afd5523b5fb2250bab4692738da64191.poster.avif?t=1770796239\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/afd5523b5fb2250bab4692738da64191.webm?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/afd5523b5fb2250bab4692738da64191.mp4?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765380?t=1770796239","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/16482497d508f24f578fbf2a790ed24c16110cb0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770796239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/f5c8587a3c24602a0ee85e165a4708c19743d333/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770796239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/f5c8587a3c24602a0ee85e165a4708c19743d333/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770796239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a cameraman, filming dead bodies and unseen horrors from the past, and instantly changing what the Death Counter watches in the future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU PLAY AS A CAMERAMAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character isn't the player\u2014it's the Death Counter (you'll see her hand counting most of the time). Your goal as the player is to influence her by showing what you're filming. You are a cameraman from the past, trying to influence someone in the future.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/6ba15bcd46f10d2e790bde77a9793c2e.poster.avif?t=1770796239\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/6ba15bcd46f10d2e790bde77a9793c2e.webm?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/6ba15bcd46f10d2e790bde77a9793c2e.mp4?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark merge of two art styles, periods, and settings. One captured in haunting films of forbidden labs, the other a shadowy office where Death Counters view them. Spirits sealed in the footage break into the office, moving from past to present, altering objects and unsettling players with paranormal activities. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/d9541dc44f1652692f797c39ea931ba8.poster.avif?t=1770796239\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/d9541dc44f1652692f797c39ea931ba8.webm?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/d9541dc44f1652692f797c39ea931ba8.mp4?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1963, the CIA began rating its archived classified footage based on the deaths captured on them. Each rating process had to be documented on camera by an assigned agent, whom they later called a &quot;Death Counter.&quot;<br> <br> Four 8mm films, shot by unnamed operatives between 1939 and 1959, were prepared for evaluation. This game is the complete process, as recorded by the Death Counters tasked with evaluating those haunting footage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as unnamed operatives from the past, tasked with filming the insides of secret laboratories worldwide. A Death Counter watches your footage in real-time and reacts based on what you show her on the screen.  <br><br>Your goal is to capture as many deaths as possible on film, ensuring the Death Counter sees them by filming corpses, unseen horrors, and beyond, to maximize her recorded death count.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/afd5523b5fb2250bab4692738da64191.poster.avif?t=1770796239\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/afd5523b5fb2250bab4692738da64191.webm?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/extras/afd5523b5fb2250bab4692738da64191.mp4?t=1770796239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Arman Pakan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765380/8cfeb943bbbc0c578d75778b6fa808c0c0808d5f/header.jpg?t=1770796239","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Code Psyche Productions. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3765380/205138199/1d4d75dde95472d12fa1ebad23a76b4b0b9732cb/1759426542/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759428166","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3765380/205138199/1d4d75dde95472d12fa1ebad23a76b4b0b9732cb/1759426542/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759428166","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3765380/205138199/1d4d75dde95472d12fa1ebad23a76b4b0b9732cb/1759426542/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759428166","id":257198842,"name":"Death Counter - Gameplay Trailer v1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198842/0df42365f66d64d0f745396b7df08c5feff9c93c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759428166"}],"name":"Death Counter","package_groups":[],"pc_requireme